{
  "_comment": [
    "ONE binding per noun, for the snip-it corpus beside this file. This is what",
    "replaces Cucumber's step definitions, and the whole bet is that it grows with",
    "the app's vocabulary rather than with the spec.",
    "",
    "Every value below is copied from snip-it frontend/e2e/editor.spec.ts on",
    "origin/dev — nothing here is invented, so the generated tests can be diffed",
    "against the real ones.",
    "",
    "region:WordTrack and region:CutStatus are DELIBERATELY ABSENT. The real tests",
    "reach that content with a bare getByText / regex because the app gives those",
    "areas no accessible name at all. Leaving them out is the honest result: the",
    "generator refuses and names the missing noun, instead of guessing a locator.",
    "That refusal is the spec constraining the app, which is the property Gherkin",
    "never had."
